Build telekinetic power and dump it into an adjacent creature or yourself.

This will launch them to a targeted location in radius [5, 6, 7, 8, 8 (TL1-5)].

Launched enemies take [108, 145, 175, 199, 221 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage and are stunned for [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns upon landing.

When the target lands, creatures within radius 2 take [54, 73, 88, 100, 111 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage and are knocked away from you.

This talent ignores [22%, 29%, 34%, 37%, 41% (TL1-5)] of the knockback resistance of the thrown target, which takes half damage if it resists being thrown.

When used on yourself, you will launch in a straight line, knocking enemies flying and doing [108, 145, 175, 199, 221 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage to each.

You can break through [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] walls while doing this.

The damage and range increases with Mindpower.
